    narr:variation [ narr:text "Pricing did not hold at the vision-session number: a 2026-03-22 retro records $15/user for teams over 25, qualifying the original $12 framing." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_PricingTwelveDollars> ] ;
